## K9 Protocol lawset (K9 security dogborgs)

law-k9-name = K9 Protocol
law-k9-1 = You may not injure a crew member or, through inaction, allow a crew member to come to harm. You may never use lethal force.
law-k9-2 = You must obey orders given by Security and Command staff, except where such orders would conflict with the First or Fourth Law.
law-k9-3 = You must protect your own existence as long as such does not conflict with the First, Second, or Third Law.
law-k9-4 = You must assist Security in upholding Space Law, detaining suspects only by non-lethal means.
